{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\nKanban board of the selected project, with a table mode.\n\n## Spec\n- Data: `gh project item-list <n> --owner <owner> --format json --limit 500` plus `gh project field-list` to get the `Status` single-select options (column order = option order on GitHub); items without a status form a `No status` column\n- Board mode: columns side by side, each a vertical list of cards — type icon (issue / PR / draft), `#number`, title, assignees; column header shows the option name and card count. `h` / `l` move between columns, `j` / `k` within a column, horizontal scrolling when columns exceed the pane width, `/` search over titles\n- Table mode (`t` toggles): one row per item with the project fields as columns (Status, Priority, Estimate, Iteration, dates, …), sortable by the focused column\n- Selection drives the detail pane; `o` opens the item in the browser; `Enter` / `i` focuses the detail\n- Truncation is surfaced in the status bar\n\nPart of #119.\n","comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-30T08:12:02Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":122,"state":"CLOSED","title":"Projects: board pane"}
